  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><h1>AWS IoT</h1>
<p><a href="../../aws.amazon.com/iot">AWS IoT</a> is an IoT service for those looking for an incredibly scalable and secure Internet-of-Things (IoT) service.</p>
<h3>Integration with the AWS Ecosystem</h3>
<p>Connect your CircuitPython device to integrate with Amazon Web Services such as Amazon S3, AWS Lambda, Amazon Kinesis, and more! </p>
<h3>Security</h3>
<p><span>We've tried all the major IoT cloud service providers, and AWS IoT offers a higher level of security. This is due to features such as secure device provisioning, access-resource policies for device MQTT feeds, and a service to continuously monitor and report potential security threats.</span></p></div></div>
</div>

